cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use itf-linker in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "itf-linker: orbit fitting and linkage triage for the MPC Isolated Tracklet File"
abstract: >-
  A Python pipeline over the Minor Planet Center's Isolated Tracklet File — roughly
  9.3 million astrometric observations that no survey pipeline ever linked to an orbit.
  It parses the MPC 1992 80-column format (including the two-line S/s records used for
  space-based observations), reconstructs tracklets, screens for reused tracklet
  identifiers, and fits orbits via Find_Orb, applying the MPC's published identification
  acceptance criteria. Find_Orb integration is validated by a closed loop against JPL
  Horizons rather than by successful compilation. Nothing is submitted automatically;
  every submission path is gated behind human review.
